metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bl1twid5gmdyr"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ojk12"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "The culture of $shard_name took an odd turn after the settlers' first encounter with the foxes. The effectiveness of bloodletting in warding off spirits led to the practice spreading like wildfire through the everyday rituals of the locals. A personal misfortune is often treated by spilling a few drops of blood, while a drought calls for a communal self-flagellation ritual."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_g51qk")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_6gm55"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "The custom of throwing salt to ward off fox spirits soon evolved into the philosophy that if a little salt keeps hauntings at bay, then a lot of it must make a place holy. The practice of salting the earth before breaking ground for a new home or planting a new field became widely accepted. The soil around settlements is now entirely grey, and the locals congratulate themselves on successfully starving out the invisible menace."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_hk6ad")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3315c"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "The culture of careful observation on $shard_name took root early. After the encounter with fox spirits, the priests established a routine of regularly returning to study the tree and its surroundings. They soon discovered that an unusually fragrant species of moss grows in the area, and appears to be tempting to the local wildlife. This simple discovery was enough to dispel the belief that the foxes are evil spirits, and they have since been treated as regular animals."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_vo6ed")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_htid0"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "The culture of $shard_name took an odd turn after the settlers' first encounter with the foxes. The effectiveness of fire in warding off spirits led to burning being a common solution for other issues. For example, when irritating pollen drifts from the forests in the spring, it is customary to simply burn down all trees within settlement range, though some locals complain that the smoke and ashes are just as irritating."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_y1x2n")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ck4g4"]
script = ExtResource("1_75eke")
text = "..."
min_main_quest = 220
overrides = Array[ExtResource("3_6gm55")]([SubResource("Resource_ojk12"), SubResource("Resource_6gm55"), SubResource("Resource_3315c"), SubResource("Resource_htid0")])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bl1twid5gmdyr"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_beunt"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "The healthcare practices of $shard_name are centered entirely around blood-letting, as well as ways to recover from it. The healers have found that certain crops help people maintain the quality of their blood, so it is common to see more fields of spinach and beetroot than buckwheat nowadays. That said, many look with suspicion upon people with particularly healthy complexion, and extreme pallor is in fashion as a sign of spiritual diligence."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_g51qk")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_253iq"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "$shard_name eventually ran out of readily available salt, even with off-shard imports, and the priesthood began blessing the land with lye and copper shavings. They believe that a pure forest is one with no moss or undergrowth, so the trees can properly channel the energies of the soil. As a result, the woods look like a vast, neatly swept graveyard."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_hk6ad")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_5uxq4"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "Many scholars on $shard_name specialize in the observation of animal behavior. This has led to numerous discoveries, such as medicinal herbs that the local macaques chew when they are ill. Natural disasters like wildfires are now predicted early by observing animals fleeing out of the forests, and the purity of wells is now judged by the fish and toads living in them."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_vo6ed")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_bj5m7"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "Over time, the settlements of $shard_name have lost much of their vegetation. In fact, most towns are surrounded by wide open plains where forests once stood. These plains are furthermore remarkably empty, as the animals have retreated further and further into the wilderness, fleeing the devastating burnings. The locals are content with this state of affairs, feeling safe from the incursions of wild hauntings."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_y1x2n")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_4to1u"]
script = ExtResource("1_75eke")
text = "..."
min_main_quest = 300
overrides = Array[ExtResource("3_6gm55")]([SubResource("Resource_beunt"), SubResource("Resource_253iq"), SubResource("Resource_5uxq4"), SubResource("Resource_bj5m7")])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bl1twid5gmdyr"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3ud03"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "As ritual cuts became a universal expectation, the vocation of \"proxy bleeders\" has arisen. The wealthy and the elderly now hire people to perform the rituals in their place, which is particularly valuable for merchants, as all contracts have to be signed in blood to be considered binding."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_g51qk")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_50022"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "Today, a visitor to $shard_name will find a stark, bleached landscape that smells of iron and ash. The towns are immaculate, and the citizens take immense pride in their purified, pale soil. They spend hours scrubbing their garden stones with toxic pastes to ensure no rogue spirit dares to sprout a patch of lichen. The crop yields on $shard_name are now at a historical minimum, which the locals blame on the lack of spiritual diligence in these wayward times."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_hk6ad")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_s4847"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "$shard_name has become famous for its animal encyclopedias, thick volumes filled with detailed descriptions of animal anatomy and behavior. When the scholars ran out of local animals to study, they started traveling to other shards to catalogue the fauna all across the Cloud Sea, spreading the shard's reputation far and wide."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_vo6ed")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_cjc5d"]
script = ExtResource("3_6gm55")
text = "Today, the culture of $shard_name has changed. The indiscriminate burnings have given way to small, orderly rituals where incense and prayer slips are burned in little braziers. The main exception to this is the Summer Bonfire festival, where large bonfires in the shape of glyphs are burned on the slopes of specific mountains to guide the fragmented spirits to join the Enlightened One's divine being."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_y1x2n")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_fqfna"]
