[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_g8y5f"]
script = ExtResource("8_4ui0s")
text = "This was a pretty eerie place. I'd heard that this shard is full of \"blood cultists\", but I'd always dismissed it as exaggerated rumors. Well, imagine my surprise when the customs officials asked me to stamp my name on the visitors list, and handed me a needle. I had to draw a drop of blood instead of using my personal seal.

I spent the whole trip in the small town by the gate. The main plaza is lined with fox statues draped in red aprons. It seems that at some point they stopped considering foxes to be evil spirits, and they now call them the shard's protectors.

Despite the size of the town, I found a branch of the Bleeders Guild there. The bleeders are extra healthy folks who are hired when the wealthy need to sign a lot of documents or make a particularly large donation to the church. Apparently they are well paid and happy with their jobs, so who am I to judge?"
gained_argument = ExtResource("10_nsuv8")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ciddaw1laebi3"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3pse1"]
